WEBVTT

00:00:09.168 --> 00:00:11.754
Drac, I can't believe how calm
you are about her leaving.
德古拉,我不敢相信你那么冷静

00:00:11.838 --> 00:00:13.256
I'm proud of you.
我替你骄傲.德古拉?

00:00:13.339 --> 00:00:15.550
Drac? Drac?
德古拉?

00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:17.218
Where did Drac go?
德古拉去了哪里?

00:00:23.308 --> 00:00:25.560
This is awesome!
太棒了!

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.897
There's the cemetery, just like Dad said.
坟场在那里,正如爸所说

00:01:04.432 --> 00:01:05.683
Hello?
有人吗?

00:01:07.518 --> 00:01:09.103
Anybody out there?
有人吗?

00:01:18.655 --> 00:01:20.782
-Vampire.
-Bite toes!
-吸血鬼! -咬脚趾!

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:23.618
Hi, humans.
你好,人类

00:01:26.537 --> 00:01:30.208
Everything okay?
My name is Mavis Dracula, and I...
我叫马维丝德古拉,我..

00:01:30.291 --> 00:01:31.542
Vampire.
吸血鬼!

00:01:31.626 --> 00:01:33.336
-Burn clothes.
-Burn my clothes?
-烧衣服! -烧我的衣服?

00:01:33.419 --> 00:01:35.505
-Really?
-Vampire!
-说真的吗? -吸血鬼!

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:38.966
-We take your candy.
-Candy!
我们抢你的糖果!

00:01:39.258 --> 00:01:41.636
I'm friendly. I really am.
我是友善的!真的

00:01:41.761 --> 00:01:43.513
-Calm down, now.
-Candy.
-糖果 -冷静

00:01:43.846 --> 00:01:45.890
I just wanted to say hi.
我只是想打个招呼

00:02:05.034 --> 00:02:06.202
Please. I've never hurt anyone.
拜托!我从来没伤过人!我在家自学

00:02:06.327 --> 00:02:08.329
I'm homeschooled.
拜托!我从来没伤过人!我在家自学

00:02:08.454 --> 00:02:10.456
Is that garlic?
那是蒜头吗?

00:02:22.468 --> 00:02:23.803
Holy rabies, you're on fire.
天啊,你着火了.我可以帮你吗?

00:02:23.845 --> 00:02:25.722
Can I do anything? Can I help you?
天啊,你着火了.我可以帮你吗?

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:28.349
Dad was right.
爸说得对

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:31.352
Dad was right.
爸说得对

00:02:38.526 --> 00:02:41.070
It worked.
成功了

00:02:41.195 --> 00:02:45.324
Now my baby will be safe forever.
现在我的宝贝永远安全了

00:02:47.535 --> 00:02:49.996
All right, everybody, get back to work now.
好了各位,回去工作

00:02:53.875 --> 00:02:57.545
Hey. You don't need a mannequin.
嘿!你不需要模特!

00:02:57.587 --> 00:02:59.422
Leave the mannequin here. Come on.
把模特留下!拜托!

00:03:21.194 --> 00:03:22.236
Where you been?
你去了哪里?为何那么鬼祟?

00:03:22.361 --> 00:03:24.197
Why you sneaking around?
你去了哪里?为何那么鬼祟?

00:03:24.739 --> 00:03:26.407
Quiet.
安静!

00:03:26.532 --> 00:03:30.244
Sweetheart, have you returned so soon?
宝贝,你那么快回来了?

00:03:30.369 --> 00:03:31.579
Come in, Dad.
进来,爸

00:03:31.704 --> 00:03:33.581
How'd it go? How was the big world?
怎样?外面世界怎样?

00:03:33.706 --> 00:03:35.291
How was it out there?
怎样?外面世界怎样?

00:03:35.416 --> 00:03:36.626
It was okay, Dad.
很好,爸

00:03:36.751 --> 00:03:38.294
What? What's the matter?
什么?怎么啦?

00:03:38.419 --> 00:03:40.129
Dad, you were right.
爸,你说得对

00:03:40.254 --> 00:03:41.714
Humans are awful.
人类很可怕!他们正如你所说!

00:03:41.756 --> 00:03:43.591
They were everything you said.
人类很可怕!他们正如你所说!

00:03:43.633 --> 00:03:45.802
-They wanted to bite my toes.
-Your toes?
-他们要咬我的脚趾! -你的脚趾?

00:03:45.927 --> 00:03:47.929
And they had garlic on bread.
他们有蒜头!在面包上!

00:03:48.054 --> 00:03:49.972
What? Look at me.
什么?看着我!我很害怕!

00:03:50.097 --> 00:03:53.434
I'm getting goose bumps, I'm so scared.
什么?看着我!我很害怕!

00:03:55.937 --> 00:03:57.647
I'm so sorry, sweetheart.
我很抱歉,宝贝.我很遗憾你看到

00:03:57.772 --> 00:04:00.274
I hate that you had to see that.
我很抱歉,宝贝.我很遗憾你看到

00:04:00.399 --> 00:04:02.902
I'm so sorry I doubted you.
我很抱歉我怀疑你

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:07.281
I'll never leave here again.
我永远不会离开这里

00:04:07.323 --> 00:04:10.618
Okay. Okay.
好.好

00:04:10.743 --> 00:04:15.414
Look, Daddy's going to make you
the bestest birthday ever.
听好,爸爸将给你一个最好的生日!

00:04:15.456 --> 00:04:16.791
Look what I brought you.
看我带给你什么!虫蛋糕!

00:04:16.916 --> 00:04:18.751
Your wormcakes.
看我带给你什么!虫蛋糕!

00:04:20.253 --> 00:04:21.963
Don't be sad anymore.
不要伤心了

00:04:22.004 --> 00:04:26.509
Remember, this is the year
we open Mommy's present for you.
记住,今年我们打开妈给你的礼物

00:04:26.634 --> 00:04:28.177
What did she get me?
-她给我什么? -我们会知道

00:04:28.302 --> 00:04:29.470
We'll see.
-她给我什么? -我们会知道

00:04:29.512 --> 00:04:33.683
She said never to open until you're 118.
她说等到你118岁才打开

00:04:33.808 --> 00:04:35.643
We've waited this long.
我们等了那么久

00:04:35.768 --> 00:04:37.019
You eat your wormcakes.
吃你的虫蛋糕

00:04:37.144 --> 00:04:40.147
You come down
whenever you're ready, honey.
准备好后下来,宝贝

00:04:44.193 --> 00:04:45.444
What did you do?
你做了什么?

00:04:45.486 --> 00:04:46.612
What I had to.
我该做的事

00:04:47.947 --> 00:04:49.490
She'll thank me one day.
有一天她会感谢我

00:04:49.532 --> 00:04:53.035
Yeah, that's what the guy
who shrunk my head said.
对,缩小我的头的人也这样说

